## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-15. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Wind of Nature
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Golden Staff over Blade of Despair when Use when you need faster passive procs and the enemy team is not especially tanky.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic burst or mixed dive where physical immunity will not stop the first engage.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when a healer, shield support, or high-extra-HP fighter is keeping the front line alive.
- Total cost: 11920 gold

Standard gold lane build that maximizes Siphon Starlium damage through raw physical attack while keeping enough attack speed to proc the passive consistently.

### Front-to-Back Anti-Tank (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar, Wind of Nature
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Sea Halberd
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Sea Halberd when Use when the enemy has armor but not enough healing or shield value to justify anti-heal.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic burst if the main threat is a mage assassin or magic damage jungler.; Immortality over Malefic Roar when Use if a physical assassin can bypass your tank and one-shot you before the front line collapses.
- Total cost: 10960 gold

Prioritizes percent-based damage and anti-heal for tank-heavy drafts where you need to chew through high-HP frontlines.

### Safe Late Game (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Wind of Nature, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Wind of Nature
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when the team can reliably peel and you need penetration to close out the game.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use against heavy magic burst where you need both the shield and hybrid defense.; Golden Staff over Blade of Despair when Use when you need faster passive procs and the enemy team is not especially tanky.
- Total cost: 11980 gold

Defensive setup for games with heavy dive or lockdown where surviving the first engage matters more than maximizing the final damage slot.

